ing these heights back to the input's segments. In Train 3's input, I found a segment of length 1! I'm now testing other segment lengths.\n\n\n**Validating the Correlation**\n\nI've got a solid correlation! Analyzing Train 3's segments, I've confirmed that the lengths 1, 3, and 6 correspond precisely to the output column heights. I've successfully validated this pattern in Train 2 as well, where input lengths 1, 3, 6, and 7 create output column heights of 1, 3, 6, and 7. I'm now testing Train 1's inputs!\n\n\n",
